<!doctype html>
<meta charset="utf8">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/8.4/styles/github.min.css">
<pre class="metadata">
title: Bitwise counting
stage: 0
contributors: J. S. Choi, Richard Gibson
</pre>

<emu-clause id="sec-math.ctz32">
  <h1>Math.ctz32 ( _x_ )</h1>
  <p>This function performs the following steps when called:</p>
  <emu-alg>
    1. Let _n_ be ? ToUint32(_x_).
    1. Let _p_ be the number of trailing zero bits in the unsigned 32-bit binary representation of _n_.
    1. Return 𝔽(_p_).
  </emu-alg>
  <emu-note>
    <p>If _n_ is either *+0*<sub>𝔽</sub> or *-0*<sub>𝔽</sub>, this method returns *32*<sub>𝔽</sub>. If the least significant bit of the 32-bit binary encoding of _n_ is 1, this method returns *+0*<sub>𝔽</sub>.</p>
  </emu-note>
</emu-clause>

<emu-clause id="sec-math.popcount32">
  <h1>Math.popcount32 ( _x_ )</h1>
  <p>This function performs the following steps when called:</p>
  <emu-alg>
    1. Let _n_ be ? ToUint32(_x_).
    1. Let _p_ be the number of one bits in the unsigned 32-bit binary representation of _n_.
    1. Return 𝔽(_p_).
  </emu-alg>
</emu-clause>
